  "description": "About 66 million years ago, an asteroid roughly 10 km wide struck the Yucatán Peninsula and left the Chicxulub crater, about 180 km across. Dust and soot blocked the Sun, the planet cooled and about three in four species disappeared. Small animals survived, like some mammals, and dinosaurs didn't vanish completely: birds are dinosaurs. Original 3D animation; not to scale.",
